  message: "Folds in WI-pagoj (owner-approved 2026-11-01, root-cause sweep 2026-11-01 (dev b27eb0e0d0; lab ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/tracker_hygiene_sweep_2026-11-01T223538Z/); WI-pagoj closed wont_do with duplicate_of here). same root (LlvmIrAnalyzer inherits base register_symbol, an unconditional overwrite, so a declare replaces a define in the bare-name table) and same fix (prefer definitions over declarations, the pattern c.py already uses). WI-pagoj was the 11-01 split restating it with acceptance criteria; those criteria now apply here. The test-order half stays in WI-sipoj. Read WI-pagoj's thread for its repro and evidence."  # b0ed
